abstract: >-
  A corrective, deterministic 200-seed benchmark of coupled-state convergence
  and perturbation recovery. Attractive coupling separates from an uncoupled
  control, but dynamic coupling does not outperform matched fixed coupling and
  the entropy-curvature diagnostic does not exceed its circular-shift surrogate.
